  <main>
    <section class="hero wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow">Submit a sighting claim</div>
      <h1>DROP THE CLAIM. KEEP THE BOUNDARY.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Submit source links only. No doxxing, private addresses, naming ordinary lookalikes, illegal material or claim stronger than the source supports.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section wrap split">
      <div class="card redline submission-boundary">
        <h2>Verified Free Member posting</h2>
        <p>Reading is public. Posting requires a verified Free Member session to reduce spam and preserve an accountable correction trail. No payment is required.</p>
        <div class="submission-actions"><a class="btn" href="member-login.html?return=%2Fepstein-sighting-submit.html">Create or access free account</a><a class="btn alt" href="terms-of-use.html">Posting terms</a><a class="btn alt" href="trust-privacy-policy.html">Privacy</a></div>
